  "description": "<p>I tried creating an archival group with</p>\n\n<p>curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H\"Slug: test1\" -H'Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ArchivalGroup\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ArchivalGroup</a>&gt;;rel=\"type\"' -H\"Content-type: text/turtle\" -XPOST <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest</a></p>\n\n<p>and then creating a child object with</p>\n\n<p>curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H\"Slug: child1\" -H\"Content-type: text/turtle\" -XPOST <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test1</a></p>\n\n<p>Then I stopped and restarted the server and tried to delete the child object with</p>\n\n<p>curl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -i <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1/child1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test1/child1</a> -XDELETE</p>\n\n<p>and got</p>\n\n<p>HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error<br/>\nDate: Wed, 15 Apr 2020 18:59:30 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node0e03q3j0dlv2z1w87llybcsiib8.node0; Path=/<br/>\nExpires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT<br/>\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Tue, 14-Apr-2020 18:59:30 GMT<br/>\nContent-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8<br/>\nContent-Length: 8039<br/>\nServer: Jetty(9.4.24.v20191120)</p>\n\n<p>org.fcrepo.persistence.api.exceptions.PersistentItemNotFoundException: Could not find child1 within object test1<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.DefaultOCFLObjectSession.delete(DefaultOCFLObjectSession.java:211)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.DeleteResourcePersister.persist(DeleteResourcePersister.java:56)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.OCFLPersistentStorageSession.persist(OCFLPersistentStorageSession.java:163)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.DeleteResourceServiceImpl.delete(DeleteResourceServiceImpl.java:129)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.DeleteResourceServiceImpl.deleteDepthFirst(DeleteResourceServiceImpl.java:119)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.DeleteResourceServiceImpl.perform(DeleteResourceServiceImpl.java:78)<br/>\n at org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.deleteObject(FedoraLdp.java:352)</p>",
